No license has been chosen for this project yet.

This is a template repository — the appropriate license depends entirely on
how you plan to distribute your copy of it:

- Keeping it private / personal portfolio use: no license needed here.
- Open-sourcing your fork: pick a standard license (MIT, Apache-2.0, etc.)
  and replace this file with its text.
- Selling it on a marketplace (e.g. CodeCanyon/Envato): that marketplace
  supplies its own license terms for buyers: do not add a permissive
  open-source license here, as it would let buyers redistribute the source
  freely and undercut the sale.

Until you decide, treat this repository as "all rights reserved" by
default — no permission is granted to copy, modify, or redistribute it.
